Job Descriptions
Duties and responsibilities at this level will entail: -
Implementing records management policies, strategies, regulations and procedures;
Ensuring security of information, documents, files and office equipment;
Opening files and file indexing;
Controlling the opening and retrieval of files;
Ensuring security of information/files in the registry;
Compiling relevant School’s records for use by various stakeholders;
Up-dating and maintaining up-to-date file movement records;
Supervising the receipt and dispatch of mails;
Sorting and classifying documents for filing and storage;
